  m_text: 'Marine mammals meet all the normal characteristics land mammals do. Warm
    blooded, Breathe air through their longs, and give birth to live young. Except
    marine mammals either live in the ocean (like whales and narwhals) or spend significant
    portions of their live in the ocean for purposes like hunting (like sea otters).
    Commonly known marine mammals include whales, walruses, sea otters, polar bears,
    porpoises, dugongs, and seals. '
