  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Turtles are reptiles whose bodies are encased in a hard bony shell. You
    probably already knew that. Let me spit you some cool turtle facts. Did you know
    that the sex of sea turtles in determined by the temperature of the nest in the
    sand? Leather back turtles have been around since the age of dinosaurs in their
    current form. A turtle\u2019s shell is actually part of its skeleton. It\u2019s
    made up of over 50 bones which include the turtle\u2019s rib cage and spine."
