      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Sharks are very misunderstood creatures. Painted as violent mindless killers
    by popular media sharks are not seen positively in the public light. Despite
    this, sharks are extremely critical to marine ecosystems for many reasons. While
    they might be seen as violent creates, in most cases they are actually quite
    sweet. Most breeds of sharks are friendly or passive to humans as long as they
    are not provoked. With some species, such as the lemon and nurse sharks they
    even exibit behaviors of enjoying human affection and even seeking it out similar
    to dogs. '
