      m_Calls: []
  m_text: FIsh are astonishing creatures. Scientists report that there are aproximately
    20,000 spcies of fish on the planet. Some fish species you might be farmiliar
    with is salmon, cod, tuna, and bass which are all commonly found and eaten in
    the US. Scientists can tell a fish's age by counting the growth rings on its
    scales or ear bones. Fish swim primarily by contracting bands of muscles in sequence
    on alternate sides of the body. This whips the tail very rapidly from side to
    side in a sculling motion. Vertical fins are used mainly for stabilization. Paired
    pectoral and pelvic fins are used primarily for stability when a fish hovers.
    Sometimes fish might use them to aid rapid forward motion.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
